{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-domestar-vase-fillers-sold-via-desertcart-2512-0238","content_id":"d691a493-3e0b-462a-aabf-8401d843d4fb","description":"Product Safety Report for DOMESTAR Vase Fillers presenting a high risk of asphyxiation.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"53fa6418-cdd0-4391-84a6-26c71edb6f2f","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-02-03T14:20:39+00:00","id":"53fa6418-cdd0-4391-84a6-26c71edb6f2f","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-02-03T14:20:39+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69820437f2ea511998158fc0/2512-0238-product-safety-report-domestar-vase-filler.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: DOMESTAR Vase Fillers sold via Desertcart</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a high risk of asphyxiation because if the product is swallowed in its hydrated form it can block a young child’s airway.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Desertcart).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Decorative articles/Homeware/Gardenware - Flower/Plant Pots Replacement Parts/Accessories</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Desertcart Listing Name</td>\n      <td>DOMESTAR 15000PCS Colorful Vase Fillers</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Desertcart Product ID</td>\n      <td>629743242</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>United States</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>15,000 water beads of various colours (purple, blue, orange, yellow, pink) in a clear, plastic vacuum sealed bag. Packaging includes a card stating ‘Domestar’ on it.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_53fa6418-cdd0-4391-84a6-26c71edb6f2f\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69820437f2ea511998158fc0/2512-0238-product-safety-report-domestar-vase-filler.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a high risk of asphyxiation because if the product is swallowed in its hydrated form it can block a young child’s airway.</p>\n\n<p>OPSS has published a Product Safety Alert for water beads, which can be accessed at: <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-alert-water-beads-psa7\">https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-alert-water-beads-psa7</a>.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Desertcart).</p>\n\n<p>Owners are advised to stop using the product immediately and keep it out of the reach of children. Contact the distributor you purchased from to request redress.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2512-0238</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-03T17:17:56Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"household-decorative-articles","product_measure_type":["removal-of-listing-by-online-marketplace"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-02-03","product_risk_level":"high"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-02-03T17:17:56+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-domestar-vase-fillers-sold-via-desertcart-2512-0238","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-domestar-vase-fillers-sold-via-desertcart-2512-0238","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-domestar-vase-fillers-sold-via-desertcart-2512-0238","content_id":"d691a493-3e0b-462a-aabf-8401d843d4fb","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-02-03T17:17:56Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Safety Report: DOMESTAR Vase Fillers sold via Desertcart (2512-0238)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-domestar-vase-fillers-sold-via-desertcart-2512-0238","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Serious","value":"serious"},{"label":"High","value":"high"},{"label":"Medium","value":"medium"},{"label":"Low","value":"low"},{"label":"Not provided","value":"not-provided"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_risk_l